

   =====( TrionLOP V0.67 )=============================================


           Trion Log-off Police Utility.

           (c) Copyright Paul Spijkerman, '96-'97. All rights reserved.

           Written for use with the Trion BBS package.


   ===================================================================


        This is a simple programm that will write a message to
        a User if he drops carrier in stead of logging out.

        To use this utility place something like this in
        the logout scripts for node 1 and higher.


        doors:trionlop/trionlop 3


        Call this programm with the number of a (private) local
        message section.

        The message which it sends is contained in the file:

        doors:trionlop/trionlop.msg

        You can change this file if you don't like it and use
        a few C-type variabels in it.

        %n   =   name of user.
        %t   =   time of log-off
        %d   =   date of log-off


